  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development, by virtue of its form, bulk, detailed design, materials would appear visually intrusive, incongruous, overly dominant and out of keeping and thereby harm the character and appearance of the Southgate Green Conservation Area as a designated heritage asset. This harm is not outweighed by planning benefits, contrary to: Section 72(1) of the Planning (Listed Buildings and Conservation Areas) Act 1990; Section 20 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2026); Policy D3 and HC1 of the London Plan (2021); CP31 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010); DMD13, DMD37 and DMD44 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014) and the Southgate Green Conservation Area Character Appraisal (2015)."
